{"t": 1792767934818, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "last", "Clearing 15 debris (17 after the rafter is sawn) one piece per trip to the door took from tick ~3300 to ~21900 (~10 game minutes, i.e. most of a first 15-minute session) with no way to carry more than one. Feels like a chore; consider carrying 2-3 small pieces or a quicker toss. Also walking up to a piece and pressing E can silently fail when it is >12 deg off the crosshair."]}
